    <!--
      Nova Star, per the Novawerk brand mark (brand/visual-identity.md):
      two concentric four-pointed stars. The inner core is an evenOdd cutout
      so the surface shows through it — matching the canonical B&W variant
      (ink star, ground-coloured core) and the dark variant (cream star,
      core punches to ground). Rendered via Icon(tint=...) at each call site
      so a single asset adapts: ink on light surfaces, cream on dark.
      fillColor here is only the untinted fallback.
    -->
    <path
        android:fillColor="#0F0F0F"
        android:fillType="evenOdd"
